<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The procurement and farm installation phases have been completed successfully \("On track"\). The training modules have been deployed to the target demographic. We are currently monitoring the colonization rates of the hives. A potential delay has been identified regarding the publication of the peer-reviewed journal article associated with the research component. Mitigation strategies, including additional academic support for the research team, are being implemented to ensure this deliverable is met in the subsequent reporting cycle.)
/E (The procurement and farm installation phases have been completed successfully \("On track"\). The training modules have been deployed to the target demographic. We are currently monitoring the colonization rates of the hives. A potential delay has been identified regarding the publication of the peer-reviewed journal article associated with the research component. Mitigation strategies, including additional academic support for the research team, are being implemented to ensure this deliverable is met in the subsequent reporting cycle.)
