207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (At Indigenous Peoples Alliance Ghana \(IPA-GH\), safeguarding is a core institutional commitment and an integral part of how we deliver our mission. Beyond compliance with donor and regulatory requirements, safeguarding reflects our responsibility to protect the rights, dignity, and well-being of the communities we serve. Given our direct engagement with marginalized groups including rural women, youth, persons with disabilities, and indigenous farmers, we uphold a strict zero-tolerance policy toward all forms of harassment, exploitation, abuse, or neglect.)
/E (At Indigenous Peoples Alliance Ghana \(IPA-GH\), safeguarding is a core institutional commitment and an integral part of how we deliver our mission. Beyond compliance with donor and regulatory requirements, safeguarding reflects our responsibility to protect the rights, dignity, and well-being of the communities we serve. Given our direct engagement with marginalized groups including rural women, youth, persons with disabilities, and indigenous farmers, we uphold a strict zero-tolerance policy toward all forms of harassment, exploitation, abuse, or neglect.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
