210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Our outreach strategy is designed with built-in protective measures to mitigate risks associated with power imbalances. During our regional workshops, such as the Southern and Northern Ghana sessions, we implemented strict protocols to ensure safe participation. This included funding travel to remove economic barriers and selecting venues that were accessible to persons with disabilities and the elderly. Furthermore, recognizing the cultural hierarchies that often silence women in public forums, we engineered our sessions to disrupt these dynamics safely. In the Northern Ghana Workshop, we successfully created a protected space where 27 female farmers could lead discussions on climate adaptation, shifting local power dynamics while ensuring their cultural safety.)
/E (Our outreach strategy is designed with built-in protective measures to mitigate risks associated with power imbalances. During our regional workshops, such as the Southern and Northern Ghana sessions, we implemented strict protocols to ensure safe participation. This included funding travel to remove economic barriers and selecting venues that were accessible to persons with disabilities and the elderly. Furthermore, recognizing the cultural hierarchies that often silence women in public forums, we engineered our sessions to disrupt these dynamics safely. In the Northern Ghana Workshop, we successfully created a protected space where 27 female farmers could lead discussions on climate adaptation, shifting local power dynamics while ensuring their cultural safety.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
