/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In executing our National Research Study and Storytelling projects, safeguarding the intellectual and personal data of our contributors was paramount. With over 300 data contributors involved, we adhered to strict ethical standards regarding informed consent and representation. Our "Documenting Everyday Realities" initiative required staff to undergo training in culturally sensitive communication to ensure that the stories of indigenous resilience were captured accurately and respectfully, without exploitation. We ensured that the 300+ youth and indigenous contributors were not merely subjects of study but active partners whose knowledge was validated and protected for national policy influence.)
/E (In executing our National Research Study and Storytelling projects, safeguarding the intellectual and personal data of our contributors was paramount. With over 300 data contributors involved, we adhered to strict ethical standards regarding informed consent and representation. Our "Documenting Everyday Realities" initiative required staff to undergo training in culturally sensitive communication to ensure that the stories of indigenous resilience were captured accurately and respectfully, without exploitation. We ensured that the 300+ youth and indigenous contributors were not merely subjects of study but active partners whose knowledge was validated and protected for national policy influence.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
