/T (Operating in a fluctuating economic environment, IPA-GH adopted a prudent approach to forex management. The budget was calculated at a fixed exchange rate of 12.5 GHS/USD, with a specific line item for "Bank Charges" and "Forex losses" totaling GHS 5,405.97. This buffer allowed the organization to absorb transfer fees and minor exchange rate dips without compromising projects delivery. )
